node_modules/
package-lock.json
out/
artifacts/
cache/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/deployments/localhost-*.json
relayer/.bundles/

# Circuit build products. The proving key alone is ~150MB and the SRS is a download, so the
# repo carries the sources that regenerate them (spec.json, export_onnx.py, pipeline.py) rather
# than the products themselves. Verifier.sol is checked in as an exception — it is the artifact
# that actually gets deployed, and it should be reviewable in a diff.
circuits/build/*
!circuits/build/Verifier.sol
circuits/.venv/
__pycache__/

# Working documents. `*.local.md` is scratch space for briefs and design notes that belong to
# whoever is holding the work, not to the protocol repo's history.
*.local.md
